lculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record from 1951 to 2025 shows November to December came in under 90% of normal in 40 of 75 years on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids. In 2025 that pair ran 34% of normal on the middle, and October to November ran 56%. So far in 2026 the middle sits at 26% for February to March and 31% for March to April. Grid 25312 had its driest year in 2012 at 42% of normal.</p>"}
